msgid "Video tools are bundled with this app. Update or reinstall the package to repair them."
msgstr "此應用程式已內建影片工具。請更新或重新安裝套件以修復工具。"

msgid "Video tools are busy. Wait for them to finish, then load the new link."
msgstr "影片工具忙碌中。請等待完成後再載入新連結。"

msgid "Video tools are provided by this app package. Update or reinstall the app to repair them."
msgstr "影片工具由此應用程式套件提供。請更新或重新安裝應用程式以修復工具。"

msgid "Video tools are ready. Update yt-dlp if a site stops working."
msgstr "影片工具已就緒。若網站無法使用，請更新 yt-dlp。"

